Spec: Default-network change observation

Purpose:
  Invalidate owned transport generations when the application's actual default route or link addresses change.

Owns:
  ./NetworkObserver.java

Must:
  Register only read-only default-network callbacks, compare current network rather than stale callback arguments and coalesce events on one bounded owned worker.
  Keep addresses/routes in memory only; publish no candidate or interface details in public diagnostics.
  Stop callbacks and owned work on host close without starting services, changing routing or occupying the VPN slot.
